              "col4": "<a title=\"Observations\" href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"navigate('Structure___19_0_4_45f01b9_1674406832907_5231_497');return false;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><img src='images/block_class_icon.png' width='16' height='16' title='' style=\"vertical-align: bottom;\"></span></a><a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"navigate('Structure___19_0_4_45f01b9_1674406832907_5231_497');return false;\">&nbsp;<code>Observations</code></a> groups one or more <span style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><img src='images/block_class_icon.png' width='16' height='16' title='' style=\"vertical-align: bottom;\"></span>&nbsp;<code>Observation</code>s made by the <a title=\"Component\" href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"navigate('Structure__EAID_8548C620_467A_4f50_9A22_58D84B7E8779');return false;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><img src='images/block_class_icon.png' width='16' height='16' title='' style=\"vertical-align: bottom;\"></span></a><a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"navigate('Structure__EAID_8548C620_467A_4f50_9A22_58D84B7E8779');return false;\">&nbsp;<code><em>&lt;&lt;abstract&gt;&gt&nbsp;Component</em></code></a> entity.</p>\n\n<p><a title=\"Component\" href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"navigate('Structure__EAID_8548C620_467A_4f50_9A22_58D84B7E8779');return false;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><img src='images/block_class_icon.png' width='16' height='16' title='' style=\"vertical-align: bottom;\"></span></a><a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"navigate('Structure__EAID_8548C620_467A_4f50_9A22_58D84B7E8779');return false;\">&nbsp;<code><em>&lt;&lt;abstract&gt;&gt&nbsp;Component</em></code></a> make <span style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><img src='images/block_class_icon.png' width='16' height='16' title='' style=\"vertical-align: bottom;\"></span>&nbsp;<code>Observation</code>s about observed <a title=\"DataItem\" href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"navigate('Structure__EAID_002C94B7_1257_49be_8EAA_CE7FCD7AFF8A');return false;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><img src='images/block_class_icon.png' width='16' height='16' title='' style=\"vertical-align: bottom;\"></span></a><a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"navigate('Structure__EAID_002C94B7_1257_49be_8EAA_CE7FCD7AFF8A');return false;\">&nbsp;<code>DataItem</code></a>s.</p>\n\n<p>See <a title=\"Observation Information Model\" href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"navigate('Package___19_0_3_45f01b9_1579566288489_320279_24855');return false;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><img src='images/package_icon.png' width='16' height='16' title='' style=\"vertical-align: bottom;\"></span></a><a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"navigate('Package___19_0_3_45f01b9_1579566288489_320279_24855');return false;\">&nbsp;<em>Observation Information Model</em></a> for the <span style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><img src='images/block_class_icon.png' width='16' height='16' title='' style=\"vertical-align: bottom;\"></span>&nbsp;<code>Observation</code> model.</p>\n\n<blockquote>\n  <p>Note 1 to entry: In the <em>XML</em> representation, <span style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><img src='images/block_class_icon.png' width='16' height='16' title='' style=\"vertical-align: bottom;\"></span>&nbsp;<code>Observation</code> entities <strong>MUST NOT</strong> appear in the <span class=\"hoverterm\" title=\"response document published by an MTConnect Agent in response to a probe request.\">MTConnectDevices Response Document</span>.</p>\n</blockquote>\n\n<blockquote>\n  <p>Note 2 to entry: In the <em>XML</em> representation, <span style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><img src='images/block_class_icon.png' width='16' height='16' title='' style=\"vertical-align: bottom;\"></span>&nbsp;<code>Observation</code> entities <strong>MUST</strong> appear only in the <span class=\"hoverterm\" title=\"response document published by an MTConnect Agent in response to a current request or a sample request.\">MTConnectStreams Response Document</span>.</p>\n</blockquote>\n",
