              "col1": "<a title=\"ConfigurationRelationship\" href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"navigate('Structure__EAID_28132294_DF39_4e8e_8AE5_B79565F991A2');return false;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><img src='images/block_class_icon.png' width='16' height='16' title='' style=\"vertical-align: bottom;\"></span></a><a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"navigate('Structure__EAID_28132294_DF39_4e8e_8AE5_B79565F991A2');return false;\">&nbsp;<code><em>&lt;&lt;abstract&gt;&gt&nbsp;ConfigurationRelationship</em></code></a> is an abstract entity and hence will be realized by specific <a title=\"ConfigurationRelationship\" href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"navigate('Structure__EAID_28132294_DF39_4e8e_8AE5_B79565F991A2');return false;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><img src='images/block_class_icon.png' width='16' height='16' title='' style=\"vertical-align: bottom;\"></span></a><a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"navigate('Structure__EAID_28132294_DF39_4e8e_8AE5_B79565F991A2');return false;\">&nbsp;<code><em>&lt;&lt;abstract&gt;&gt&nbsp;ConfigurationRelationship</em></code></a> types in an <a title=\"MTConnectDevices\" href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"navigate('Structure__EAID_76BFE349_267B_45b3_B5FF_3C89D29AE715');return false;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><img src='images/block_class_icon.png' width='16' height='16' title='' style=\"vertical-align: bottom;\"></span></a><a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"navigate('Structure__EAID_76BFE349_267B_45b3_B5FF_3C89D29AE715');return false;\">&nbsp;<code>MTConnectDevices</code></a> entity. See <em>Section ComponentRelationship</em> and <em>Section DeviceRelationship</em>."
