              "col3": "1 </br>",
              "col4": " </br>",
              "col5": "name of the <a title=\"Device\" href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"navigate('Structure___19_0_3_68e0225_1620240839406_285612_1596');return false;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><img src='images/block_class_icon.png' width='16' height='16' title='' style=\"vertical-align: bottom;\"></span></a><a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"navigate('Structure___19_0_3_68e0225_1620240839406_285612_1596');return false;\">&nbsp;<code>Device</code></a>.</p>\n\n<p>The value reported for <a title=\"DeviceStream\" href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"navigate('Structure__EAID_02192189_58E6_456c_A679_CDDFF559DA00');return false;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><img src='images/block_class_icon.png' width='16' height='16' title='' style=\"vertical-align: bottom;\"></span></a><a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"navigate('Structure__EAID_02192189_58E6_456c_A679_CDDFF559DA00');return false;\">&nbsp;<code>DeviceStream</code></a><code>::name</code> <strong>MUST</strong> be the same as the value defined for the <a title=\"Device\" href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"navigate('Structure___19_0_3_68e0225_1620240839406_285612_1596');return false;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><img src='images/block_class_icon.png' width='16' height='16' title='' style=\"vertical-align: bottom;\"></span></a><a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"navigate('Structure___19_0_3_68e0225_1620240839406_285612_1596');return false;\">&nbsp;<code>Device</code></a><code>::name</code> in the <span class=\"hoverterm\" title=\"response document published by an MTConnect Agent in response to a probe request.\">MTConnectDevices Response Document</span>.",
