              "col1": "specific applications <strong>MAY</strong> reference one or more locations on a piece of bar stock as the indication for the <a title=\"EndOfBar\" href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"navigate('Structure___19_0_3_45f01b9_1580378218288_775940_1776');return false;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><img src='images/block_class_icon.png' width='16' height='16' title='' style=\"vertical-align: bottom;\"></span></a><a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"navigate('Structure___19_0_3_45f01b9_1580378218288_775940_1776');return false;\">&nbsp;<code>EndOfBar</code></a>.</p>\n\n<p>The main or most important location <strong>MUST</strong> be designated as the <code>PRIMARY</code> indication for the <a title=\"EndOfBar\" href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"navigate('Structure___19_0_3_45f01b9_1580378218288_775940_1776');return false;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><img src='images/block_class_icon.png' width='16' height='16' title='' style=\"vertical-align: bottom;\"></span></a><a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"navigate('Structure___19_0_3_45f01b9_1580378218288_775940_1776');return false;\">&nbsp;<code>EndOfBar</code></a>.</p>\n\n<p>If no <code>subType</code> is specified, <code>PRIMARY</code> <strong>MUST</strong> be the default <a title=\"EndOfBar\" href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"navigate('Structure___19_0_3_45f01b9_1580378218288_775940_1776');return false;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><img src='images/block_class_icon.png' width='16' height='16' title='' style=\"vertical-align: bottom;\"></span></a><a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"navigate('Structure___19_0_3_45f01b9_1580378218288_775940_1776');return false;\">&nbsp;<code>EndOfBar</code></a> indication."
