              "col1": "Tools are located in <a title=\"Station\" href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"navigate('Structure___19_0_3_68e0225_1605552257415_810787_2672');return false;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><img src='images/block_class_icon.png' width='16' height='16' title='' style=\"vertical-align: bottom;\"></span></a><a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"navigate('Structure___19_0_3_68e0225_1605552257415_810787_2672');return false;\">&nbsp;<code><em>&lt;&lt;leaf&gt;&gt;</em>&nbsp;Station</code></a> entities. Tools are positioned for use in the manufacturing process by linearly positioning the <a title=\"GangToolBar\" href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"navigate('Structure___19_0_3_68e0225_1605551885706_266977_2498');return false;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><img src='images/block_class_icon.png' width='16' height='16' title='' style=\"vertical-align: bottom;\"></span></a><a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"navigate('Structure___19_0_3_68e0225_1605551885706_266977_2498');return false;\">&nbsp;<code>GangToolBar</code></a>."
