              "col2": "<a title=\"LocationTypeEnum\" href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"navigate('Enumeration__EAID_0167FC5F_C61F_4bc7_A1B3_C724FE8865BA');return false;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><img src='images/enum_type_icon.png' width='16' height='16' title='' style=\"vertical-align: bottom;\"></span></a><a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"navigate('Enumeration__EAID_0167FC5F_C61F_4bc7_A1B3_C724FE8865BA');return false;\">&nbsp;LocationTypeEnum</a>",
              "col3": "1 </br>",
              "col4": " </br>",
              "col5": "type of location being identified.</p>\n\n<p>When a <code>POT</code> or <code>STATION</code> type is used, <a title=\"Location\" href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"navigate('Structure__EAID_A012A42B_DBEC_4334_891D_5B45D7A7E340');return false;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><img src='images/block_class_icon.png' width='16' height='16' title='' style=\"vertical-align: bottom;\"></span></a><a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"navigate('Structure__EAID_A012A42B_DBEC_4334_891D_5B45D7A7E340');return false;\">&nbsp;<code>Location</code></a><code>::value</code><strong>MUST</strong> be a numeric value.<br/><br/>The <code>type</code> <b>MUST</b> be specified",
