              "col3": "1..* </br>",
              "col4": "<code>Errors</code> groups one or more <a title=\"Error\" href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"navigate('Structure___19_0_3_91b028d_1579560710732_245440_6708');return false;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><img src='images/block_class_icon.png' width='16' height='16' title='' style=\"vertical-align: bottom;\"></span></a><a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"navigate('Structure___19_0_3_91b028d_1579560710732_245440_6708');return false;\">&nbsp;<code><em>&lt;&lt;abstract&gt;&gt&nbsp;Error</em></code></a> entities. See <em>Section Error</em>.</p>\n\n<blockquote>\n  <p>Note: When compatibility with Version 1.0.1 and earlier of the MTConnect Standard is required for an implementation, the <span class=\"hoverterm\" title=\"response document published by an MTConnect Agent whenever it encounters an error while interpreting an MTConnect Request.\">MTConnectErrors Response Document</span> contains only a single <a title=\"Error\" href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"navigate('Structure___19_0_3_91b028d_1579560710732_245440_6708');return false;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><img src='images/block_class_icon.png' width='16' height='16' title='' style=\"vertical-align: bottom;\"></span></a><a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"navigate('Structure___19_0_3_91b028d_1579560710732_245440_6708');return false;\">&nbsp;<code><em>&lt;&lt;abstract&gt;&gt&nbsp;Error</em></code></a> entity and the <code>Errors</code> entity <strong>MUST NOT</strong> appear in the document.</p>\n</blockquote>\n",
