              "col3": "0..1 </br>",
              "col4": " </br>",
              "col5": "pointer to the <a title=\"Motion\" href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"navigate('Structure__EAID_1F084FBF_2AC7_41f6_8485_C356E6D7A9C1');return false;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><img src='images/block_class_icon.png' width='16' height='16' title='' style=\"vertical-align: bottom;\"></span></a><a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"navigate('Structure__EAID_1F084FBF_2AC7_41f6_8485_C356E6D7A9C1');return false;\">&nbsp;<code>Motion</code></a><code>::id</code>.</p>\n\n<p>The kinematic chain connects all components using the parent relations. All motion is connected to the motion of the parent. The first node in the chain will not have a parent.",
