              "col5": "identifier of the <a title=\"Composition\" href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"navigate('Structure___19_0_3_68e0225_1658936424016_561586_139');return false;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><img src='images/block_class_icon.png' width='16' height='16' title='' style=\"vertical-align: bottom;\"></span></a><a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"navigate('Structure___19_0_3_68e0225_1658936424016_561586_139');return false;\">&nbsp;<code><em>&lt;&lt;abstract&gt;&gt&nbsp;Composition</em></code></a> entity defined in the <span class=\"hoverterm\" title=\"response document published by an MTConnect Agent in response to a probe request.\">MTConnectDevices Response Document</span> associated with the data reported for the <span style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><img src='images/block_class_icon.png' width='16' height='16' title='' style=\"vertical-align: bottom;\"></span>&nbsp;<code>Observation</code>.",
