              "col3": "1 </br>",
              "col4": " </br>",
              "col5": "unique identifier of the <a title=\"DataItem\" href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"navigate('Structure__EAID_002C94B7_1257_49be_8EAA_CE7FCD7AFF8A');return false;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><img src='images/block_class_icon.png' width='16' height='16' title='' style=\"vertical-align: bottom;\"></span></a><a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"navigate('Structure__EAID_002C94B7_1257_49be_8EAA_CE7FCD7AFF8A');return false;\">&nbsp;<code>DataItem</code></a> associated with this <span style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><img src='images/block_class_icon.png' width='16' height='16' title='' style=\"vertical-align: bottom;\"></span>&nbsp;<code>Observation</code>.</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><img src='images/block_class_icon.png' width='16' height='16' title='' style=\"vertical-align: bottom;\"></span>&nbsp;<code>Observation</code><code>::dataItemId</code> <strong>MUST</strong> match the associated <a title=\"DataItem\" href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"navigate('Structure__EAID_002C94B7_1257_49be_8EAA_CE7FCD7AFF8A');return false;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><img src='images/block_class_icon.png' width='16' height='16' title='' style=\"vertical-align: bottom;\"></span></a><a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"navigate('Structure__EAID_002C94B7_1257_49be_8EAA_CE7FCD7AFF8A');return false;\">&nbsp;<code>DataItem</code></a><code>::id</code> defined in the <span class=\"hoverterm\" title=\"response document published by an MTConnect Agent in response to a probe request.\">MTConnectDevices Response Document</span>.",
