              "col3": "1 </br>",
              "col4": "<div title=\"true\" style=\"display: inline !important; white-space: nowrap !important; height: 20px;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><img src='images/icon_42.png' width='16' height='16' title='' style=\"vertical-align: bottom;\"></span> true</div></br>",
              "col5": "when <code>true</code>, <span style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><img src='images/block_class_icon.png' width='16' height='16' title='' style=\"vertical-align: bottom;\"></span>&nbsp;<code>Observation</code><code>::result</code> is indeterminate.</p>\n\n<blockquote>\n  <p>Note 1 to entry: In <em>XML</em>, when <code>isUnavailable</code> is <code>true</code>, the <em>XML</em> <code>CDATA</code> of the <code>Observation</code> <strong>MUST</strong> be <code>UNAVAILABLE</code>.\n <code>xml\n&amp;lt;Execution dataItemId=&amp;quot;...&amp;quot; ...&gt;UNAVAILABLE&amp;lt;/Execution&gt;\n</code></p>\n</blockquote>\n\n<blockquote>\n  <p>Note 2 to entry: In <em>JSON</em>, when <code>isUnavailable</code> is <code>true</code>, the <em>JSON</em> <code>value</code> of the <code>Observation</code> <strong>MUST</strong> be <code>UNAVAILABLE</code>.\n<code>json\n  &amp;quot;Execution&amp;quot; : [ { &amp;quot;dataItemId&amp;quot;: &amp;quot;...&amp;quot; ..., &amp;quot;value&amp;quot;: &amp;quot;UNAVAILABLE&amp;quot; } ]\n</code></p>\n</blockquote>\n",
