              "col5": "same as <a title=\"DataItem\" href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"navigate('Structure__EAID_002C94B7_1257_49be_8EAA_CE7FCD7AFF8A');return false;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><img src='images/block_class_icon.png' width='16' height='16' title='' style=\"vertical-align: bottom;\"></span></a><a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"navigate('Structure__EAID_002C94B7_1257_49be_8EAA_CE7FCD7AFF8A');return false;\">&nbsp;<code>DataItem</code></a><code>::nativeUnits</code>. See <em>Section DataItem</em>.",
