              "col2": "first <span class=\"hoverterm\" title=\"element that organizes information that represents the physical and logical parts and sub-parts of a piece of equipment.\">structural element</span> provided in a <span class=\"hoverterm\" title=\"electronic document published by an MTConnect Agent in response to a probe request, current request, sample request or asset request.\">response document</span> encoded using XML."
