              "col2": "1.1",
              "col3": null,
              "col4": null,
              "col5": "<span class=\"hoverterm\" title=\"software that collects data published from one or more piece(s) of equipment, organizes that data in a structured manner, and responds to requests for data from client software systems by providing a structured response in the form of a response document that is constructed using the semantic data model of a Standard. \n\">agent</span>’s ability to communicate with the data source."
